  "ruleText": "Ath 406.01 Obligation to Maintain BOC Certification. Licensees shall maintain BOC certification at all times.\n\nSource. #9099, eff 3-1-08; renumbered by #10228, (from Ath 405.01); ss by #10921, eff 8-29-15; ss by #14247, eff 5-16-25, EXPIRES: 5-16-35",
